0..79 Comment "//! `cancel-orders` reaps a target and cancellation completion in either order."
80..83 Comment "//!"
84..157 Comment "//! Cancellation and its target owe independent completions. The target\'s"
158..237 Comment "//! completion stays owed after the cancellation posts its own, in either order"
238..315 Comment "//! (io_uring_prep_cancel(3), io_uring_cancelation(7)). Cancellation can also"
316..366 Comment "//! take and reap the target\'s pending completion."
367..370 Comment "//!"
371..450 Comment "//! The checker tracks each completion as a separate endpoint. `cancelConsumes`"
451..502 Comment "//! transfers the pending endpoint to cancellation."
503..506 Comment "//!"
507..523 Comment "//! - see: #1229"
